OL,3,CMore than 400 World War Two shells
OL,4,Cfound in French village after wildfires
OL,6,FOn Monday, a bomb disposal operation
OL,7,Fwas carried out to recover hundreds of
OL,8,Fthe shells, a statement from the local
OL,9,Fauthority said.
OL,11,FOfficials quickly established an
OL,12,Fexclusion zone due to the risk to the
OL,13,Fpublic.
OL,15,FThe head of Bordeaux's bomb disposal
OL,16,Funit, Commandant Philippe Delemotte,
OL,17,Ftold local media an explosion could
OL,18,Fpotentially send "lethal fragments"
OL,19,Fflying several hundred metres through
OL,20,Fthe air.
