OL,3,CMore than 400 World War Two shells
OL,4,Cfound in French village after wildfires
OL,6,FOn Monday, residents in Gironde were
OL,7,Fallowed to return to their homes after
OL,8,Fsafety assessments were conducted.
OL,10,FA local resident from Le Porge told
OL,11,FITV News' US partner CNN last month
OL,12,Fthat he lost his home and pets in the
OL,13,Ffire.
OL,15,F"It was the apocalypse," the resident
OL,16,Fsaid. "Everything burned, even the
OL,17,Fanimals."
OL,19,FThe wildfire in Bordeaux is now
OL,20,Fcontained, but firefighters are still
OL,21,Fworking to prevent further flare-ups.
